{"version":1,"content":"<p>58歲歌手袁鳳瑛，當年憑一曲《天若有情》而一炮而紅，先後共了三張專輯，成績斐然。</p><p>當年她因參加歌唱比賽，令不少音樂人對她留下深刻印象，加上遇到當時有心提攜新人的導演，令她遇到成名作《天若有情》，從文員生活跳到演藝圈，她表示：「每一首歌都有難以</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T04:21:19.063871+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T04:01:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T04:18:17.447058+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T04:18:17.447058+00:00","content_hash":"632cb3d632186456e344cd803dd4eaabcda513805b34045e34b0cfb9946837f8","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}